{"toolCallId":"call_001dcf3848f24e2fbda4e4c20ada1c50","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/README.md:| `generated-metadata-drift.ts` | Re-derives a spec folder and compares stored `description.json` / `ln` against a fresh derivation, ignoring volatile timestamps; report-only until the drift gate graduates to a hard failure. |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/validation/generated-metadata-drift.ts:// compares the stored description and ln against a fresh derivation ignoring\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json:    \"rule_id\": \"ln\",\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json:    \"description\": \"Re-derives a folder and reports drift between the stored description/ln and the current docs, read-only, error under strict only when the drift-gate flag is on and otherwise grandfather report mode.\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/graph/migrate-generated-json.ts:  SPECKIT_ln_GATE: '1',\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/graph/backfill-graph-metadata.ts:    metadata.derived.ln === 'Packet metadata derived from canonical spec documents.'\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/graph/backfill-graph-metadata.ts:    || metadata.derived.ln.trim().length < 40\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/upgrade-legacy.mjs:  'GENERATED_METADATA_INTEGRITY', 'ln', 'METADATA_DISK_PATH_CONSISTENCY',\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/create.sh:    \"ln\": \"${summary_text}\",\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/test-fixtures/053-template-compliant-level2/graph-metadata.json:    \"ln\": \"Validator regression fixtures must represent valid packets\",\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/test-fixtures/004-valid-level3/graph-metadata.json:    \"ln\": \"A tiny fixture feature that synchronizes a sample catalog and records one architecture decision